<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-25697] Flaky CancelTest.testNotOriginatorNodeStop</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-25697</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Test CancelTest.testNotOriginatorNodeStop, sometimes exception thrown by query (returned by remote stopping node) is not as expected. Expected only IgniteInterruptedCheckedException, but different node components can be stopped on any step of query execution, so there is a variety of remote exceptions (thread interruption, tasks rejection by executor, query cancelation, etc).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
